            "review_title": "Review at Củi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Luisa D\nVancouver, Canada94 contributions\n0\nBeautiful space, excellent food and service\nMar 2023 • Couples\nWow that was delicious! The restaurant is beautiful and the service was excellent. We were grateful for the man on the street who had signs in English asking if we were looking for the restaurant. There’s no signage and even though google maps showed us it was very helpful to have his confirmation that we were in the right place.\nWritten March 20, 2023",
